">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050605195017&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Power_Ring_1344d9.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a power ring <span class=\"p-attributes\">(fist fighting +4)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.80 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Power Rings increase the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fist%20Fighting\">Fist Fighting</a> skill by four points, for 30 minutes. One can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/power-ring-quest\">Power Ring Quest</a>. One can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/panpipe-quest\">Panpipe Quest</a>. One is required for the <a href=\"#/quest/the-outlaw-camp-quest\">Bright Sword Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This ring used to increase <a href=\"#/wiki/Fist%20Fighting\">Fist Fighting</a> skill by six points. It was reduced to four points only after the Monk Vocation Update.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arachnophobica\">Arachnophobica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blight%20Mariner\">Bl